  description: "\xC7\xF6p kutusunun tamamen dolmas\u0131 ve at\u0131klar\u0131n ta\u015Fmas\u0131
    hem hijyen sorunlar\u0131na hem de \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131nda d\xFCzensizlik
    ve kayma\u2013\xE7arpma risklerinin artmas\u0131na neden olur. At\u0131klar\u0131n
    zaman\u0131nda bo\u015Falt\u0131lmas\u0131, ofis i\xE7i d\xFCzeni ve sa\u011Fl\u0131kl\u0131
    bir \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma ortam\u0131n\u0131 korumak i\xE7in kritik bir ad\u0131md\u0131r."
